   <middle>
+    <section anchor="motivation" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-unnumbered-1">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-motivation">Motivation</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-1-1">When a user is running the Telnet client under the X window system,
+it is useful for the remote Telnet to know the X display location of
+that client.  For example, the user might wish to start other X
+applications from the remote host using the same display location as
+the Telnet client.  The purpose of this option is to make this
+information available through telnet connections.</t>
+    </section>
